# PRD-028: do NOT hardcode VITE_API_URL here.
# A baked VITE_API_URL=/api/v1 makes `import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || apiBase`
# ALWAYS resolve to "/api/v1" (root), defeating the runtime subpath base
# (basePrefix + '/api/v1') under frontend.basePath=/supkube. Leave it unset so
# the runtime base wins. Local dev still works: vite proxies /api → :8080 and
# the fallback resolves to /api/v1 at root (no config.js in dev).
# To override for out-of-cluster dev only: VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1
